  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "There is a discrepancy between the wsdl generated by fedora, and the wsdl generated by axis. i.e. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://host/fedora/services/access?wsdl"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://host/fedora/services/access?wsdl",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " and ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://host/fedora/wsdl?api=API-A"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://host/fedora/wsdl?api=API-A",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ".  Why is that? Is this actually a bug or by design. There really isn't much documentation on consumption of the services as well, so maybe that would help.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
